      "text": "5.1  needs the dev VMs from Lab 3.2\n5.2  needs quota for 2 vCPUs in Norway East before ASR will replicate\n5.3  needs platformskycraftswcsa from Lab 4.1 to hold the flow logs\n\n# monitoring is the last module because it can only watch what already exists",
